@startuml AM

|Librarian|
start

:Receive the returned copy;
:Identify the loan;

|System|
:Check loan information;
:Close the loan;

if (Is the return late?) then (yes)
    :Activate extension point;
    :Suspend the member;
else (no)
endif

if (Is the copy reserved?) then (yes)
    :Keep the copy aside;
    :Notify the member who reserved it;
else (no)
    :Make the copy available;
endif

|Librarian|
:Complete the return process;

stop
@enduml